{"4753590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TEAM PANIC", "steam_appid": 4753590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM PANIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players, different universes, one goal: escape the game universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEAM PANIC is a 2-player online co-op adventure experience designed to create chaotic, fun, and memorable moments with a friend. Together with your friend, you become trapped inside a mysterious game universe, explore different areas, complete objectives, and search for a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To progress, you will need to work together, help each other at the right moments, and solve the challenges you encounter. Sometimes one of you will open the way while the other moves forward, sometimes you will run together, and sometimes you will panic together while trying to figure out what to do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TEAM PANIC focuses on the unexpected, funny, and exciting co-op moments that happen while playing with a friend.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 2-player co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape-focused co-op adventure experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op objectives built around progressing together with your friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, exploration, and sections that require teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic interactions between two players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moments of running together, solving together, and panicking together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic atmosphere and immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenes that create fun and memorable moments for streamers and friend groups</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>One of you will die... but the real question is:</u>    <span class=\"bb_strike\">Which one of you will survive?</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM PANIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players, different universes, one goal: escape the game universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEAM PANIC is a 2-player online co-op adventure experience designed to create chaotic, fun, and memorable moments with a friend. Together with your friend, you become trapped inside a mysterious game universe, explore different areas, complete objectives, and search for a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To progress, you will need to work together, help each other at the right moments, and solve the challenges you encounter. Sometimes one of you will open the way while the other moves forward, sometimes you will run together, and sometimes you will panic together while trying to figure out what to do next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TEAM PANIC focuses on the unexpected, funny, and exciting co-op moments that happen while playing with a friend.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 2-player co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape-focused co-op adventure experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op objectives built around progressing together with your friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, exploration, and sections that require teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic interactions between two players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moments of running together, solving together, and panicking together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic atmosphere and immersive sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenes that create fun and memorable moments for streamers and friend groups</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>One of you will die... but the real question is:</u>    <span class=\"bb_strike\">Which one of you will survive?</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "TEAM PANIC is a cinematic co-op adventure game where two players solve puzzles together, progress through teamwork, and enjoy fun moments along the way. Fransızca", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish, Estonian, Persian, Filipino, Hindi, Croatian, Catalan, Latvian, Lithuanian, Malay, Slovak, Slovenian, Serbian, Hebrew<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753590/25b7fb57a6673017e502ed303916e29c295f1ed0/header.jpg?t=1782404737", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753590/2a3e1ec3234b79e064517eba5fc2a207e7251a5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782404737", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753590/2a3e1ec3234b79e064517eba5fc2a207e7251a5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782404737", "website": "https://furkogames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 8GB<br></